   }
  },
  {
   "id": "3dd4fe18bd0d",
   "unit_id": "3dd4fe18bd0dab0463b15b16a0f3a2fe55f90a324bab94164bfb2c9d12193bb0",
   "revision_key": "97ea480aa82772b0e7b1222e0fc344bf880aec3b54c67700c56382d355616d34",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 5065,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "There are two main groups in the population here, Humans and Elves.\nHumans came here in the Age of Pyre. Our ancestors were part of a Mardrop expedition to find what had happened to the Naloren lands that sunk under the sea. Their ship was wrecked and the survivors landed on this continent.\nThey came across a group of elves, seemingly native to those lands, and befriended them - founding the Sunwall and the Gates of Morning.\nThen the orc pride came and we have been fighting for our survival ever since.",
   "target": "这里主要有两个种族，人类和精灵。\n人类在烈火纪便来到了这里。我们的祖先是马卓普探险队的成员，前去调查纳鲁精灵大陆沉入海底的经过。他们的船失事沉没，侥幸活下来的人就漂流到了这块大陆。\n他们碰到了一群似乎是这块大陆原住民的精灵，与他们结为朋友，共同创建了太阳堡垒和晨曦之门。\n后来兽人来到了这里，从那时开始我们就一直与他们战斗。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    43
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "83b9c50c80cb",
   "unit_id": "83b9c50c80cb3f1946f2ff45ba8943b7fe1c3844903df8ccfe29d0b185a1d13f",
   "revision_key": "6a82b9fa481d5d08ff2087bb75610b8f5951d8d0d5de7dfac12ec8db0daa8ef7",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
