  {
   "id": "1c33b3fdfe61",
   "unit_id": "1c33b3fdfe61b73c4fe23d4e858cc83f3e2976ccbec3b4c0f6cd37bee511a1b6",
   "revision_key": "e386b1708f8ba0dccaa4c5e9df114efc09e57a6dfe256abc94feb91b471a8ede",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 5132,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "One more bit of aid I might give you before you go. Your tale has moved me, and the very stars shine with approval of your relentless pursuit. Take their blessing, and let nothing stop you in your quest.\n\t#LIGHT_GREEN#*She touches your forehead with one cool hand, and you feel a surge of power*\n\t",
   "target": "在你出发之前我还有一样东西可以帮助你，你的故事令我感动，群星也为你“无尽追踪”的执着而闪耀。带上这个祝福，不要让任何事物阻碍你的使命。\n\t#LIGHT_GREEN#*她用冰凉的手触摸了你的额头，你感觉到身上涌现出一股力量。*\n\t",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    199
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
