   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Yes, my lady, they delayed the orcs so that I could get to the heart of the volcano. *#LIGHT_GREEN#Tell her what happened#WHITE#*",
   "target": "是的，女士。他们拖住了敌人，使我能够前进至火山中心。*#LIGHT_GREEN#告诉她发生的事。#WHITE#*",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
