   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Sorcerers? I have never heard of them. There were rumours about a new master of the Pride, but it seems they have two.\nThank you for everything. You must continue your hunt now that you know what to look for.",
   "target": "巫师？我从来没听说过他们。传说部落有了一个新的领袖，看样子现在应该有两个。\n感谢你所做的一切。既然你已经知道要找的是什么，就必须继续你的追猎。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    223,
    234
   ],
