   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Sorcerers? I have never heard of them. There were rumours about a new master of the Pride, but it seems they have two.\nI am afraid with the power they gained today they will be even harder to stop, but we do not have a choice.",
   "target": "巫师？我从来没听说过他们。传说部落有了一个新的领袖，看样子现在应该有两个。\n他们今天获得了力量，恐怕我们更难阻止他们了，不过我们别无选择。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
