   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a beautiful woman clad in shining golden armour*#WHITE#\nStop! You are clearly a stranger! Where do you come from? The Gates of Morning are the last bastion of freedom in these lands, so who are you? A spy?",
   "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前站着一位身披闪耀金色铠甲的美丽女士。*#WHITE#\n站住！你显然是个陌生人！你是从哪里来的？晨曦之门是这片土地上最后的自由堡垒，你到底是谁？是间谍吗？",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    21
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
